[00:00.000] 作词 : Paper Blush
[00:00.500] 作曲 : Paper Blush
[00:16.146]Somewhere on the shore of a lake​
[00:20.577]A cottage on a misty lake​
[00:24.928]A melancholy bird looking at me​
[00:29.480]Singing me a song​
[00:33.810]The song goes like this be yourself​
[00:38.191]Don't worry about others do as you like​
[00:42.744]Everyone is looking at you​
[00:45.687]Don't worry do what you want​
[00:51.580]The lake heard everything​
[00:55.843]The lake heard everything​
[01:00.278]The lake heard everything​
[01:04.778]The lake heard everything​
[01:08.932]I'm a bit tired today​
[01:13.366]I just wanna drink some wine​
[01:15.697]And do some laundry afterwards​
[01:19.318]I'll sleep for a long time without worrying​
[01:28.524]My consciousness sinks into the darkness​
[01:32.865]My body gradually becomes paralyzed​
[01:38.137]My soul gradually comes back to me​
[01:46.169]My consciousness returns​
[01:49.270]My body is no longer paralyzed​
[01:55.091]My soul has returned to my body​
[01:58.944]Now I'll sing a song to the lake

[00:16.146]湖畔某隅​
[00:20.577]薄雾湖上，立着小舍​
[00:24.928]一只染了愁绪的鸟，静静凝望着我​
[00:29.480]为我低吟一支歌​
[00:33.810]歌声轻落：你只管做自己就好​
[00:38.191]别被旁人的目光绊了脚，随心而行便好​
[00:42.744]纵使所有目光，都落在你身上​
[00:45.687]也无需慌，去做你心底想做的事​
[00:51.580]湖水听尽了一切​
[00:55.843]湖水听尽了一切​
[01:00.278]湖水听尽了一切​
[01:04.778]湖水听尽了一切​
[01:08.932]今日的我有几分倦​
[01:13.366]只想酌几杯酒​
[01:15.697]而后洗衣晾衣​
[01:19.318]再无半点挂碍地，沉沉睡上许久​
[01:28.524]意识慢慢沉进黑暗​
[01:32.865]身体逐渐变得麻痹​
[01:38.137]灵魂徐徐归来​
[01:46.169]意识醒转​
[01:49.270]身体恢复​
[01:55.091]灵魂归位​
[01:58.944]此刻我要对着这湖水唱一支歌​
